清晰锐利。\n\n人物形象：年轻东亚女性，清透淡妆，深色头发盘成圆润简约侗族高发髻；**简约轻量化侗族银头饰，顶部云朵造型银片装饰，下方悬挂 3 组短银片流苏；发髻侧边搭配弧形银饰板，缀有竖向银珠串流苏，头饰款式简洁，没有繁复大面积银花、长链条流苏；服装以参考图为准。颈部叠戴多层细银珠链，最外层佩戴双层银链马头吊坠，吊坠落在胸口位置。\n\n背景是干净纯净的纯白色，无多余杂物。柔和均匀的正面影棚柔光，光影干净通透，精准还原磨砂银的细腻颗粒感与抛光银饰的微弱高光，人物皮肤质感真实自然，服饰刺绣纹理、银饰细节清晰。8K 超高清，画面完整保留全部头饰，端庄素雅，侗族非遗银饰人像，写实商业人像摄影，重点突出人物与佩戴的马头银吊坠。", "empty", false, 1184579022, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 11, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name":